  "matices": "With four days each muscle is still trained twice a week, but with more sets per session. More weekly volume is associated with more hypertrophy, although the relationship is not linear and the useful maximum depends on each person and their recovery. If a week does not allow four days, it is better to spread the sessions than to always skip the same ones.",
